@baseUrl = https://localhost:7110

### krijg zaken
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cases
Accept: application/json

### Status aanpassen
Patch {{baseUrl}}/api/cases/3/Status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Bezig"
}

### Ongeldige status (400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/cases/3/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Klaar"
}

### Zaak bestaat niet (404)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/cases/99/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Bezig"
}